msgid "Credential:"
msgstr "Poverilnica:"

msgid ""
"No saved credentials yet. Tick \"Save password\" when you are asked for the "
"password, or create one in Tools > Credentials Manager."
msgstr "Shranjenih poverilnic še ni. Ko vas program vpraša za geslo, označite »Shrani geslo« ali poverilnico ustvarite v Orodja > Upravitelj poverilnic."

msgid ""
"OpenCRT answers the host's first login and password prompts with this "
"credential, unless you start typing first. Manage credentials in Tools > "
"Credentials Manager."
msgstr "OpenCRT s to poverilnico odgovori na prvi poziv gostitelja za prijavo in geslo, razen če prej začnete tipkati. Poverilnice upravljate v Orodja > Upravitelj poverilnic."

msgid ""
"The username (if the credential has one) and the saved password come from "
"this credential. Manage credentials in Tools > Credentials Manager."
msgstr "Uporabniško ime (če ga poverilnica ima) in shranjeno geslo se vzameta iz te poverilnice. Poverilnice upravljate v Orodja > Upravitelj poverilnic."

msgid "Private key file:"
msgstr "Datoteka zasebnega ključa:"

msgid "blank to use password authentication"
msgstr "prazno za overjanje z geslom"

msgid "Certificate:"
msgstr "Potrdilo:"

msgid "optional; <key file>-cert.pub is used if it exists"
msgstr "neobvezno; uporabi se <datoteka ključa>-cert.pub, če obstaja"

msgid ""
"Allow legacy algorithms (SHA-1 key exchange, CBC ciphers) for old devices"
msgstr "Dovoli zastarele algoritme (izmenjava ključev SHA-1, šifre CBC) za stare naprave"

msgid "Enable compression (for slow links)"
msgstr "Omogoči stiskanje (za počasne povezave)"

msgid "Forward the SSH agent (only to hosts you trust)"
msgstr "Posreduj agenta SSH (samo gostiteljem, ki jim zaupate)"

msgid ""
"Order tried: public key (the key file if set, otherwise keys in a running "
"SSH agent such as Pageant), then keyboard-interactive or password. Passwords "
"are only saved in a credential, in the system keychain; otherwise you are "
"asked for them when needed."
msgstr "Vrstni red poskusov: javni ključ (datoteka ključa, če je nastavljena, sicer ključi v delujočem agentu SSH, kot je Pageant), nato keyboard-interactive ali geslo. Gesla se shranjujejo samo v poverilnici, v sistemski verigi ključev; sicer jih vnesete, ko so potrebna."

