msgid "Start each line with the date and time"
msgstr "Vsako vrstico začni z datumom in časom"

msgid ""
"Also keep a raw log (.raw beside it): the bytes as received, escape "
"sequences included"
msgstr "Vodi tudi surovi dnevnik (.raw ob njem): bajti, kot so bili prejeti, vključno z ubežnimi zaporedji"

msgid "On connect:"
msgstr "Ob povezavi:"

msgid "e.g. === %S connected %Y-%M-%D %h:%m:%s ==="
msgstr "npr. === %S povezano %Y-%M-%D %h:%m:%s ==="

msgid "On disconnect:"
msgstr "Ob prekinitvi:"

msgid "Each line:"
msgstr "Vsaka vrstica:"

msgid "e.g. %H: "
msgstr "npr. %H: "

msgid ""
"Session output is appended as plain text while connected. %S expands to the "
"session name, %H to the hostname, %Y %M %D to the date and %h %m %s to the "
"time (of connecting, in the file name; of writing, in the texts above). A "
"log named with the date starts a new file at midnight."
msgstr "Izpis seje se med povezavo dodaja kot navadno besedilo. %S se razširi v ime seje, %H v ime gostitelja, %Y %M %D v datum in %h %m %s v čas (povezave v imenu datoteke; pisanja v zgornjih besedilih). Dnevnik, poimenovan z datumom, ob polnoči začne novo datoteko."

msgid ""
"A VNC desktop is the size the server sets: shown whole, scaled down when the "
"tab is smaller, or with Scale to window stretched to fill the tab. "
"Connection speed sets the picture quality; the other settings here are for "
"RDP sessions. VNC is not encrypted: set a jump host (Connection page) to "
"tunnel it through SSH."
msgstr "Namizje VNC ima velikost, ki jo nastavi strežnik: prikazano je v celoti, pomanjšano, ko je zavihek manjši, ali z možnostjo Prilagodi oknu raztegnjeno čez ves zavihek. Hitrost povezave določa kakovost slike; druge nastavitve tukaj so za seje RDP. VNC ni šifriran: nastavite vmesnega gostitelja (stran Povezava), da ga tunelirate prek SSH."

msgid "These settings are for RDP sessions."
msgstr "Te nastavitve so za seje RDP."

msgid "Desktop size:"
msgstr "Velikost namizja:"

msgid "width"
msgstr "širina"

msgid "x"
msgstr "x"

msgid "height"
msgstr "višina"

msgid "Scale to window"
msgstr "Prilagodi oknu"

msgid ""
"Blank: the remote desktop follows the tab's size. A fixed size (in pixels) "
"stays the same whatever the window does: shown whole, scaled down when the "
"tab is smaller, or with Scale to window stretched to fill the tab."
msgstr "Prazno: oddaljeno namizje sledi velikosti zavihka. Fiksna velikost (v slikovnih pikah) ostane enaka ne glede na okno: prikazano v celoti, pomanjšano, ko je zavihek manjši, ali z možnostjo Prilagodi oknu raztegnjeno čez ves zavihek."

msgid "Connection speed:"
msgstr "Hitrost povezave:"

msgid "Best quality: lossless (fast network)"
msgstr "Najboljša kakovost: brez izgub (hitro omrežje)"

msgid "Balanced: photos and video as JPEG"
msgstr "Uravnoteženo: fotografije in video kot JPEG"

msgid "Fastest: lower JPEG quality (slow links)"
msgstr "Najhitreje: nižja kakovost JPEG (počasne povezave)"

msgid "Best appearance (fast network)"
msgstr "Najboljši videz (hitro omrežje)"

msgid "Balanced: no wallpaper or animations"
msgstr "Uravnoteženo: brez ozadja in animacij"

msgid "Fastest: no visual effects (slow links)"
msgstr "Najhitreje: brez vizualnih učinkov (počasne povezave)"

msgid ""
"VNC servers with the Tight encoding (TightVNC, TigerVNC, x11vnc) send "
"pictures and video as JPEG when this is Balanced or Fastest; text and flat "
"areas stay exact. Others always send the exact picture."
msgstr "Strežniki VNC s kodiranjem Tight (TightVNC, TigerVNC, x11vnc) pošiljajo slike in video kot JPEG, ko je izbrano Uravnoteženo ali Najhitreje; besedilo in enobarvne površine ostanejo natančne. Drugi vedno pošiljajo natančno sliko."

msgid ""
"The less the server draws, the less it sends: leaving out the wallpaper and "
"animations makes the desktop noticeably quicker over the internet or a VPN."
msgstr "Manj kot strežnik riše, manj pošilja: brez ozadja in animacij je namizje prek interneta ali VPN opazno hitrejše."

msgid ""
"Use H.264 when the server offers it (much faster; turn off if the desktop "
"stays black)"
msgstr "Uporabi H.264, ko ga strežnik ponuja (precej hitreje; izklopite, če namizje ostane črno)"

msgid "Connect to the console (administrative) session, like mstsc /admin"
msgstr "Poveži se v konzolno (skrbniško) sejo, kot mstsc /admin"

msgid "Play the remote computer's sound on this computer"
msgstr "Predvajaj zvok oddaljenega računalnika na tem računalniku"

msgid "Share a local folder:"
msgstr "Deli lokalno mapo:"

msgid "none"
msgstr "brez"

msgid ""
"The folder appears on the remote computer as a drive (under This PC), named "
"after the folder: copy files to and from it there. The remote computer can "
"read, change and delete everything in it."
msgstr "Mapa se na oddaljenem računalniku prikaže kot pogon (pod Ta računalnik), poimenovan po mapi: tam kopirajte datoteke vanjo in iz nje. Oddaljeni računalnik lahko v njej bere, spreminja in briše vse."

msgid ""
"Keys mapped for this session (tried before Global Options > Keyboard), one "
"per line:"
msgstr "Tipke, preslikane za to sejo (preizkušene pred Globalne možnosti > Tipkovnica), ena na vrstico:"

msgid ""
"Key = what it does. Keys: F1-F24, Up, Home, PageUp, Insert, Delete, Tab, "
"Enter, Escape, Space or a character, with Ctrl+ Alt+ Shift+ (characters need "
"Ctrl or Alt). Text is sent (\\r is Enter); or script: file, menu: command, "
"run: program, telnet: brk|ayt|ip|ao|ec|el|ga|nop."
msgstr "Tipka = kaj naredi. Tipke: F1-F24, Up, Home, PageUp, Insert, Delete, Tab, Enter, Escape, Space ali znak, s Ctrl+ Alt+ Shift+ (znaki potrebujejo Ctrl ali Alt). Besedilo se pošlje (\\r je Enter); ali script: datoteka, menu: ukaz, run: program, telnet: brk|ayt|ip|ao|ec|el|ga|nop."

msgid "Script file:"
msgstr "Datoteka skripta:"

msgid "blank for none"
msgstr "prazno = brez"

msgid "Or write the script here (used when no file is set):"
msgstr "Ali pa skript napišite tukaj (uporabi se, ko datoteka ni nastavljena):"

msgid ""
"Runs each time the session connects. A .rhai file runs as a Rhai script and "
"a .py file as a SecureCRT Python script (see the README). Otherwise one "
"command per line: wait <text> (for the host to print it), send <text> (\\r "
"is Enter), sleep <ms>, timeout <s> (for later waits; default 30), # comment."
msgstr "Zažene se ob vsaki povezavi seje. Datoteka .rhai se izvede kot skript Rhai, datoteka .py pa kot skript SecureCRT Python (glejte README). Sicer en ukaz na vrstico: wait <besedilo> (da ga gostitelj izpiše), send <besedilo> (\\r je Enter), sleep <ms>, timeout <s> (za poznejša čakanja; privzeto 30), # komentar."

msgid "Forward X11 to the local X server"
msgstr "Posreduj X11 lokalnemu strežniku X"

msgid ""
"Uses $DISPLAY, else display 0 on this machine. The X server must accept "
"clients without its own cookie (e.g. VcXsrv with access control disabled)."
msgstr "Uporabi $DISPLAY, sicer zaslon 0 na tem računalniku. Strežnik X mora sprejemati odjemalce brez lastnega piškotka (npr. VcXsrv z onemogočenim nadzorom dostopa)."

